# FaradayOS editions. One line each; the FaradayOS Builder app shows one button per line.
#   id | button text | what it is
# Build one:  ./fedora/build-iso.sh <id>     (no id = performance)
# The ISO is out-fedora/FaradayOSv<version>-<id>.iso
# Lines in fedora/faradayos.ks between "#@if <id> ..." and "#@end" are only in those editions
# (see fedora/edition-ks.sh). To add an edition: add a line here, then tag its packages in faradayos.ks.
performance | Performance | Gaming, VR and engineering: the full FaradayOS with Steam, KDE Plasma and the VR tools
workplace   | Workplace   | Office, CAD and design: lighter, no gaming or VR, with a software catalog by category
